        <section id="about">
            <h2 >About ANITS</h2>
            <article>
                <p>
                    <strong>Anil Neerukonda Institute of Technology and Sciences (ANITS)</strong> was established in the academic year <i>2001-02</i> by the Anil Neerukonda Educational Society (ANES). 
                    The college is permanently affiliated with <u>Andhra University</u> and approved by AICTE.
                </p>
            </article>
        </section>

