        <section id="academics"> 
            <h2 >Academic Overview</h2>
            
            <h3>Offered Departments </h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Computer Science & Engineering (CSE)</li>
                <li>CSE (Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning)</li>
                <li>Electronics & Communication Engineering (ECE)</li>
                <li>Electrical & Electronics Engineering (EEE)</li>
                <li>Information Technology (IT)</li>
                <li>Mechanical Engineering</li>
            </ul>
            <h3>EAPCET / APICET Admission Steps </h3>
            <ol>
                <li>Qualify in the AP EAPCET / ICET entrance examination.</li>
                <li>Register for web counseling and select <strong>ANIL</strong> as college code.</li>
                <li>Certificate verification at designated helpline centers.</li>
                <li>Report to ANITS campus upon seat allotment and complete fee payment.</li>
            </ol>
            <p>
                To learn more about campus achievements, visit:
                <a href="https://anits.edu.in" target="_blank">ANITS Official Portal</a>
            </p>
        </section>

